le se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4edde6b1-caed-4cc1-b9c3-6862aa6882b6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-57712448-bde0-4fea-9b8d-e55b93eb3235\">안녕하세요. </span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3fa946bf-b19d-4a92-bbc6-bbe1504484c6\"><b>승리의 여신: 니케</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-106285ab-19f7-4d8b-ae75-c5e5f6aea744\">입니다.​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5b5f722b-6d5a-457b-804a-623a46c0abe2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-932fa90a-e9b4-4a5d-bdf3-3cd6b22b9f54\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7e1e7b7e-f4f8-4c2a-92ed-5c896c6f036c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-908693de-6bae-427b-82e4-2f60ce1432fc\">12/27(금) 21:30 ~ 23:00 경에 무점검 업데이트 및</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3e7f072a-270a-4521-afb9-aa6a6d04d2c3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-27f81dd4-e04f-462f-bb5e-bba447b852a4\">업데이트 리소스 다운로드가 진행되었습니다.​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e3934f6f-d58b-4cf5-a0cf-f0af147bb4ce\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-afc32b05-bbf2-4f23-9f03-6d2a9bf89d4a\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1b9d7d60-59d9-40f6-b273-c27734f89186\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d001d64f-4954-4295-8fd2-ed8338073012\">​​자세한 설명은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ce809f38-b01a-498f-811e-a7669c7751c4\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-cee16fab-efae-4db0-a740-5e53502614c0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9401d117-d89a-4218-8ee2-77ebbf3ac3fe\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-357677bf-1a35-4236-bbba-760bd34436b8\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d360c50f-551a-4750-87af-3dd40a48e76d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-16f3c657-17c6-4dd4-bb2d-ba25705d4a29\"><b>📢 12월 27일(금) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b4e23cb5-e573-4397-b9d8-bc7e787d2a3a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e13962d2-8949-499b-a558-4c834ac6fbb4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ac351d26-a2cf-46e2-b411-6050d16d6c14\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5ef63d2d-44b5-4d9e-8a8c-64191dd42fff\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ff82c1f2-ddb1-4d64-bbc4-77d85d9e6604\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e9017987-5d20-421e-a3ef-44fc1408a197\">- 12/27(금) 21:30 ~ 23:00 경​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2c5e8006-da33-4b29-883c-4fff4b77863c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-30c39a3c-f862-4470-afdb-06ddc26491a3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3c42b4b2-fed2-4406-9f47-187cadf161e7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-90f67c2b-6abc-4b25-a664-3933c454d739\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5af05992-33b0-453c-b8f6-ec03aa66b9a6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-820b410e-b6ad-4f93-bea0-e74267493d95\">- 코스튬 [아인 : 핸드메이드 페스타] SD 모델의 일부 어색한 모션을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7156ca92-031d-4496-8962-d01801f71f10\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b20bbfbf-342e-4774-9fd4-648da2cf4100\">- 독일어 환경에서 라피 : 레드 후드 스킬 1 「전황 파악」의 설명이 잘못 표시되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64ff534f-4dc5-4824-9972-3e6ff84280ad\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-663897f2-a569-46eb-aa4d-2a6b396760bd\">- 돌발 스토리 「엘리베이터 괴담」의 일부 내용을 설정에 맞도록 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4e03d834-8c10-41d8-a71d-3c88d6682046\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0a6de95c-aada-489c-94b8-ed761059b1fa\">[기존]</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7fc2a628-f7b4-43ef-872a-1f1cca7f4537\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-fd79acf8-5366-4303-90cc-39baf1807ab6\">└ 30년 전에 있었던 방주에서의 엘리베이터 사고</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b9d77b38-b4b8-48c2-b4e5-a464a9fda606\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f126e100-a96d-40dc-bfee-dc83f0566f21\">└  30년 전. 약 200기 이상의 니케가</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8c7f967d-aad2-4a62-b6f7-8a19af1d4a9f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4ce06074-aa92-4d48-9eae-be1deefb22c6\">[변경]</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5323e8ae-d73a-408b-b071-9cf25db36fb3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2befd512-1826-43af-95aa-a1c4c1f8ceb4\">└ 70년 전에 있었던 방주에서의 엘리베이터 사고</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-96b9f8b0-3f2f-48fc-8cd5-3830babce340\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ac62ab00-bb04-42a4-a84a-1693c508ebbf\">└ 70년 전. 약 200기 이상의 니케가</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cde1aa6a-fa8e-43d2-a671-51234e5f5a6d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4db45e67-6963-4377-bde5-0528453ca869\">- 특정 상황에서 루키/스페셜 아레나의 전투 판정이 정상적으로 이루어지지 않는 현상 일부 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e431c52f-82bc-4abc-868d-7e7c349c0dbf\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0866a00e-0576-41da-bbad-9c5e7f9bdaa4\">└ 실제 전투 결과 처리가 정상적으로 이루어지도록 조치하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eaa5cf28-daa0-41ab-a401-4e455d0a4886\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-72034fef-4728-48f1-b6a5-a6ea61916763\">└ 다만, 특정 상황에서 아레나 결과 화면에 승리했음에도 패배 화면이 표시되는 이슈가 발생하고 있습니다. 정상적인 전투 결과는 [전투 기록]에서 확인하실 수 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-34bafa9e-6a9c-41f7-9be8-bf5042b417cf\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3134d07d-7026-4aa7-9ad9-f38fcf03dff3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2cafd2e3-dea2-4c2d-900f-639a259ea069\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d90954e0-c5b2-46a9-abec-02a62dfbd091\">​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ea1e0117-8f02-48cd-b613-d318a6f052ec\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ac1a68b7-9e93-4106-a92c-532a586f7920\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-48c8aa5e-cd9f-492a-b9ce-375d4457bb94\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f301459e-4ca3-4b93-a1cc-405b4616b950\">·····················································································​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-91e38ce9-4382-482c-8113-15ea26d281c0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2e887298-345e-4f01-ab85-e7a63c1d6247\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-691475a6-34a0-4e56-9718-d66a5668a1f5\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-aa38acfb-62de-4c4d-84e7-415b13a08912\">​게임 이용에 불편을 끼쳐 드려 죄송합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-aa1b0993-dd6c-4f78-8930-cbfaa187dce7\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:100px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-aa1b0993-dd6c-4f78-8930-cbfaa187dce7\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDEyMjdfMjQ4/MDAxNzM1MzA4NDIxNTEz.VnVW4f1ONvkRCjec-rxi1HJ0moqznFgIWflGw2KmSr0g.eFMhF9USWxIdazL_814Q2HLEcit1Oox3ZwUbn8csGzog.PNG/241030_%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_100x100.png?type=w1678\", \"originalWidth\" : \"100\", \"originalHeight\" : \"100\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDEyMjdfMjQ4/MDAxNzM1MzA4NDIxNTEz.VnVW4f1ONvkRCjec-rxi1HJ0moqznFgIWflGw2KmSr0g.eFMhF9USWxIdazL_814Q2HLEcit1Oox3ZwUbn8csGzog.PNG/241030_%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_100x100.png?type=w1678\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-fe93b4b5-9ac6-4ee4-b406-24820a7efa1e\">\n                    <div class=\"se